 - Fridges must read at or below 5 °C and freezers at or below -15 °C. Each
   of them needs at least one reading per day.
 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## API keys and audit (schema 3)
+
+`apiKeys` contains `{ key, name, role }` records. Roles are `viewer`, `cook`, and
+`manager`. Schema 2 files migrate with empty keys and audit arrays unless already
+present; configure keys in the data file to enable API access.
+
+`audit` is append-only, containing `{ time, name, method, path, status }` for every
+non-GET API attempt. `name` is null when authentication failed. Successful writes
+and their audit entry are saved together once. Audit entries have no numeric id.
